[00:20.86]1. The living and true God—
[00:25.84]The God of all creation
[00:30.30]In ev’ry generation—
[00:36.12]Jehovah is your name.
[00:40.84]We’re honored and we’re proud
[00:45.48]To be your congregation.
[00:50.70]In ev’ry tribe and nation,
[00:56.10]Your glory we proclaim.
[01:01.46](Chorus)
[01:01.48]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[01:05.86]There is no God like you.
[01:10.60]There’s no other in the heavens
[01:15.92]Or on the earth below.
[01:20.66]You alone are God Almighty,
[01:26.76]And this all men must know.
[01:31.86]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[01:36.34]We have no other God but you.
[01:51.70]2. You cause us to become
[01:57.28]Whatever you desire,
[02:01.42]To do as you require—
[02:07.02]Jehovah is your name.
[02:11.74]And Witnesses for you
[02:16.42]Is what you’ve kindly named us.
[02:21.78]We’re honored you have claimed us—
[02:26.84]A people for your name.
[02:33.12](Chorus)
[02:33.12]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[02:36.80]There is no God like you.
[02:41.48]There’s no other in the heavens
[02:46.92]Or on the earth below.
[02:51.58]You alone are God Almighty,
[02:56.92]And this all men must know.
[03:02.30]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[03:07.62]We have no other God but you.
